{"timestamp": "2026-07-28T14:44:42.474191", "benchmark": "gaia", "group": "no_mem", "phase": "test", "task_id": "gaia_7bd855d8-463d-4ed5-93ca-5fe35145f733", "task_desc": "Answer the following question accurately.\n\nQuestion: The attached Excel file contains the sales of menu items for a local fast-food chain. What were the total sales that the chain made from food (not including drinks)? Express your answer in USD with two decimal places.", "augmented_prompt": "", "response": "```python\nimport os\nimport glob\n\n# List files in current directory and common locations\nprint(\"Current directory:\", os.getcwd())\nprint(\"Files in current directory:\")\nfor f in os.listdir('.'):\n    print(f)\nprint(\"\\nSearching for excel files...\")\nfor ext in ['*.xlsx', '*.xls', '*.csv']:\n    for f in glob.glob(f'**/{ext}', recursive=True):\n        print(f)\n```", "expected": "89706.00", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "method": "exact_match", "execution_mode": "default", "error": "", "category": "", "level": "1", "patch_injected": false, "aug_len": 0, "iteration": 0, "iter_total": 3, "mutated": false, "fb_score": null, "fb_mode": "gold", "code_rev": "3f7502f7.ff40ae22", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "metadata_author": "critic", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "gold", "judge_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "protocol_hash": "cda8cfafe9da", "prof_total_s": 317.72, "prof_embed_s": 0.0, "prof_docker_s": 0.0, "prof_llm_io_s": 317.72, "prof_tok_in": 267, "prof_tok_out": 243, "prof_llm_calls": 1}
{"timestamp": "2026-07-28T14:44:43.877809", "benchmark": "gaia", "group": "no_mem", "phase": "test", "task_id": "gaia_50ec8903-b81f-4257-9450-1085afd2c319", "task_desc": "Answer the following question accurately.\n\nQuestion: A standard Rubik’s cube has been broken into cubes making up its sides. The cubes are jumbled, and one is removed. There are 6 cubes with one colored face, 12 edge cubes with two colored faces, and 8 corner cubes with three colored faces. All blue cubes have been found. All cubes directly left, right, above, and below the orange center cube have been found, along with the center cube. The green corners have all been found, along with all green", "augmented_prompt": "", "response": "Standard Rubik’s color opposites are white–yellow, red–orange, blue–green. The 12 edge pieces are all pairs of non‑opposite colors.\n\nFrom the clues:\n- All blue cubes found → edges: white‑blue, yellow‑blue, red‑blue, orange‑blue.\n- Orange center plus its four face‑adjacent edges found → orange‑white, orange‑yellow, orange‑blue, orange‑green.\n- All orange cubes are found (corners are blue or green, all of which are found), so the opposite (red) face cubes are found → red‑white, red‑yellow, red‑blue, red‑green.\n- Green pieces bordering yellow → yellow‑green edge (corners already counted).\n\nThe edges accounted for are:  \nwhite‑blue, yellow‑blue, red‑blue, orange‑blue, orange‑white, orange‑yellow, orange‑green, red‑white, red‑yellow, red‑green, yellow‑green.  \nThat is 11 edges. The only missing edge is white‑green.\n\ngreen, white", "expected": "green, white", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "method": "exact_match", "execution_mode": "default", "error": "", "category": "", "level": "1", "patch_injected": false, "aug_len": 0, "iteration": 0, "iter_total": 3, "mutated": false, "fb_score": null, "fb_mode": "gold", "code_rev": "3f7502f7.ff40ae22", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "metadata_author": "critic", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "gold", "judge_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "protocol_hash": "cda8cfafe9da", "prof_total_s": 484.67, "prof_embed_s": 0.0, "prof_docker_s": 0.0, "prof_llm_io_s": 484.67, "prof_tok_in": 777, "prof_tok_out": 16050, "prof_llm_calls": 2}
