{"timestamp": "2026-07-28T14:48:03.415605", "benchmark": "gaia", "group": "no_mem", "phase": "test", "task_id": "gaia_0a65cb96-cb6e-4a6a-8aae-c1084f613456", "task_desc": "Answer the following question accurately.\n\nQuestion: During the first week of August 2015, one of the NASA Astronomy Pictures of the Day shows the lights of a city on the horizon. The namesake of this city also has a landmark building in Chicago named after him. What is the name of the architectural firm that designed this landmark building? Give the first name appearing in the name of the firm as of June 2023.", "augmented_prompt": "", "response": "The APOD from early August 2015 shows the lights of Marquette, Michigan on the horizon. Marquette is named after Jacques Marquette, for whom Chicago’s Marquette Building is also named. That building was designed by Holabird & Roche, the firm now known as Holabird & Root. The first name in the firm’s name as of June 2023 is:\n\nHolabird", "expected": "Holabird", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "method": "exact_match", "execution_mode": "default", "error": "", "category": "", "level": "2", "patch_injected": false, "aug_len": 0, "iteration": 0, "iter_total": 3, "mutated": false, "fb_score": null, "fb_mode": "gold", "code_rev": "3f7502f7.ff40ae22", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "metadata_author": "critic", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "gold", "judge_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "protocol_hash": "cda8cfafe9da", "prof_total_s": 684.21, "prof_embed_s": 0.0, "prof_docker_s": 0.0, "prof_llm_io_s": 684.21, "prof_tok_in": 635, "prof_tok_out": 14654, "prof_llm_calls": 2}
