{"timestamp": "2026-07-28T14:50:14.277412", "benchmark": "gaia", "group": "no_mem", "phase": "test", "task_id": "gaia_2dfc4c37-fec1-4518-84a7-10095d30ad75", "task_desc": "Answer the following question accurately.\n\nQuestion: According to Box Office Mojo's 2020 Worldwide Box Office list, how many of the top 10 highest-grossing worldwide movies are also on the top 10 highest-grossing domestic movies? Your answer should be a numerical integer value.", "augmented_prompt": "", "response": "The 2020 worldwide top 10 on Box Office Mojo includes three Chinese films with negligible or zero US domestic grosses (The Eight Hundred, My People, My Homeland, and Jiang Ziya). The remaining seven films (Bad Boys for Life, 1917, Tenet, Sonic the Hedgehog, Dolittle, Jumanji: The Next Level, and Birds of Prey) all ranked within the domestic top 10 for 2020.\n\n7", "expected": "6", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "method": "exact_match", "execution_mode": "default", "error": "", "category": "", "level": "2", "patch_injected": false, "aug_len": 0, "iteration": 1, "iter_total": 3, "mutated": false, "fb_score": null, "fb_mode": "gold", "code_rev": "3f7502f7.ff40ae22", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "metadata_author": "critic", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "gold", "judge_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "protocol_hash": "cda8cfafe9da", "prof_total_s": 496.5, "prof_embed_s": 0.0, "prof_docker_s": 0.0, "prof_llm_io_s": 496.5, "prof_tok_in": 581, "prof_tok_out": 6513, "prof_llm_calls": 2}
