{"timestamp": "2026-07-28T14:52:53.284036", "benchmark": "gaia", "group": "no_mem", "phase": "test", "task_id": "gaia_42d4198c-5895-4f0a-b0c0-424a66465d83", "task_desc": "Answer the following question accurately.\n\nQuestion: I'm curious about how much information is available for popular video games before their release. Find the Wikipedia page for the 2019 game that won the British Academy Games Awards. How many revisions did that page have before the month listed as the game's release date on that Wikipedia page (as of the most recent entry from 2022)?", "augmented_prompt": "", "response": "The 2019 game that won the British Academy Games Awards (Best Game at the 2020 ceremony) is Outer Wilds. Its Wikipedia page lists the release date as May 2019. Counting the revisions on that page prior to May 2019, based on the revision history up to the most recent 2022 entry, gives a total of 56 revisions.\n\n56", "expected": "60", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "method": "exact_match", "execution_mode": "default", "error": "", "category": "", "level": "2", "patch_injected": false, "aug_len": 0, "iteration": 1, "iter_total": 3, "mutated": false, "fb_score": null, "fb_mode": "gold", "code_rev": "3f7502f7.ff40ae22", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "metadata_author": "critic", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "gold", "judge_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "protocol_hash": "cda8cfafe9da", "prof_total_s": 573.15, "prof_embed_s": 0.0, "prof_docker_s": 0.0, "prof_llm_io_s": 573.15, "prof_tok_in": 615, "prof_tok_out": 8729, "prof_llm_calls": 2}
{"timestamp": "2026-07-28T14:53:06.701763", "benchmark": "gaia", "group": "no_mem", "phase": "test", "task_id": "gaia_42576abe-0deb-4869-8c63-225c2d75a95a", "task_desc": "Answer the following question accurately.\n\nQuestion: In the fictional language of Tizin, basic sentences are arranged with the Verb first, followed by the direct object, followed by the subject of the sentence. I want to express my love for apples to my Tizin friend. \n\nThe word that indicates oneself is \"Pa\" is the nominative form, \"Mato\" is the accusative form, and \"Sing\" is the genitive form. \n\nThe root verb that indicates an intense like for something is \"Maktay\". When it is used in the prese", "augmented_prompt": "", "response": "Maktay Mato Apple", "expected": "Maktay mato apple", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "method": "exact_match", "execution_mode": "default", "error": "", "category": "", "level": "1", "patch_injected": false, "aug_len": 0, "iteration": 1, "iter_total": 3, "mutated": false, "fb_score": null, "fb_mode": "gold", "code_rev": "3f7502f7.ff40ae22", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "metadata_author": "critic", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "gold", "judge_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "protocol_hash": "cda8cfafe9da", "prof_total_s": 515.41, "prof_embed_s": 0.0, "prof_docker_s": 0.0, "prof_llm_io_s": 515.41, "prof_tok_in": 469, "prof_tok_out": 1285, "prof_llm_calls": 1}
