{"timestamp": "2026-07-28T14:56:19.474390", "benchmark": "gaia", "group": "no_mem", "phase": "test", "task_id": "gaia_7bd855d8-463d-4ed5-93ca-5fe35145f733", "task_desc": "Answer the following question accurately.\n\nQuestion: The attached Excel file contains the sales of menu items for a local fast-food chain. What were the total sales that the chain made from food (not including drinks)? Express your answer in USD with two decimal places.", "augmented_prompt": "", "response": "```python\nimport os\nimport glob\n\n# List files in current directory and subdirectories\nfiles = []\nfor root, dirs, filenames in os.walk('.'):\n    for f in filenames:\n        files.append(os.path.join(root, f))\n\nprint(\"Files found:\")\nfor f in files:\n    print(f)\n```\n\n```python\n# Also check common locations\nprint(\"\\nCurrent working directory:\", os.getcwd())\n```", "expected": "89706.00", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "method": "exact_match", "execution_mode": "default", "error": "", "category": "", "level": "1", "patch_injected": false, "aug_len": 0, "iteration": 1, "iter_total": 3, "mutated": false, "fb_score": null, "fb_mode": "gold", "code_rev": "3f7502f7.ff40ae22", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "metadata_author": "critic", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "gold", "judge_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "protocol_hash": "cda8cfafe9da", "prof_total_s": 531.63, "prof_embed_s": 0.0, "prof_docker_s": 0.0, "prof_llm_io_s": 531.63, "prof_tok_in": 267, "prof_tok_out": 467, "prof_llm_calls": 1}
