{"timestamp": "2026-07-28T15:01:42.141214", "benchmark": "gaia", "group": "no_mem", "phase": "test", "task_id": "gaia_2b3ef98c-cc05-450b-a719-711aee40ac65", "task_desc": "Answer the following question accurately.\n\nQuestion: Could you help me out with this assignment? Our professor sprung it on us at the end of class Friday, and I'm still trying to figure it out. The question he asked us was about an anagram. I've attached an audio recording of the question that he asked, so if you could please take a listen and give me the answer, I'd really appreciate the help. Please limit your response to the anagram text that could be generated from the original line which fu", "augmented_prompt": "", "response": "nag a ram", "expected": "To be or not to be that is the question whether tis nobler in the mind to suffer the slings and arrows of outrageous fortune", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "method": "exact_match", "execution_mode": "default", "error": "", "category": "", "level": "2", "patch_injected": false, "aug_len": 0, "iteration": 1, "iter_total": 3, "mutated": false, "fb_score": null, "fb_mode": "gold", "code_rev": "3f7502f7.ff40ae22", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "metadata_author": "critic", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "gold", "judge_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "protocol_hash": "cda8cfafe9da", "prof_total_s": 688.67, "prof_embed_s": 0.0, "prof_docker_s": 0.0, "prof_llm_io_s": 688.67, "prof_tok_in": 719, "prof_tok_out": 3439, "prof_llm_calls": 2}
{"timestamp": "2026-07-28T15:01:45.204608", "benchmark": "gaia", "group": "no_mem", "phase": "test", "task_id": "gaia_4fc2f1ae-8625-45b5-ab34-ad4433bc21f8", "task_desc": "Answer the following question accurately.\n\nQuestion: Who nominated the only Featured Article on English Wikipedia about a dinosaur that was promoted in November 2016?", "augmented_prompt": "", "response": "The only dinosaur article promoted to Featured Article status on English Wikipedia in November 2016 was **Ankylosaurus**. Its featured article candidacy was nominated by the Wikipedia editor **FunkMonk**.\n\nFunkMonk", "expected": "FunkMonk", "score": 1.0, "em": 0.0, "method": "exact_match", "execution_mode": "default", "error": "", "category": "", "level": "1", "patch_injected": false, "aug_len": 0, "iteration": 1, "iter_total": 3, "mutated": false, "fb_score": null, "fb_mode": "gold", "code_rev": "3f7502f7.ff40ae22", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "metadata_author": "critic", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "gold", "judge_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "protocol_hash": "cda8cfafe9da", "prof_total_s": 838.02, "prof_embed_s": 0.0, "prof_docker_s": 0.0, "prof_llm_io_s": 838.02, "prof_tok_in": 523, "prof_tok_out": 14502, "prof_llm_calls": 2}
{"timestamp": "2026-07-28T15:01:59.436314", "benchmark": "gaia", "group": "no_mem", "phase": "test", "task_id": "gaia_076c8171-9b3b-49b9-a477-244d2a532826", "task_desc": "Answer the following question accurately.\n\nQuestion: The attached file contains a list of vendors in the Liminal Springs mall, along with each vendor’s monthly revenue and the rent they pay the mall. I want you to find the vendor that makes the least money, relative to the rent it pays. Then, tell me what is listed in the “type” column for that vendor.", "augmented_prompt": "", "response": "```python\nimport os\nprint(os.listdir('.'))\n```", "expected": "Finance", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "method": "exact_match", "execution_mode": "default", "error": "", "category": "", "level": "2", "patch_injected": false, "aug_len": 0, "iteration": 2, "iter_total": 3, "mutated": false, "fb_score": null, "fb_mode": "gold", "code_rev": "3f7502f7.ff40ae22", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "metadata_author": "critic", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "gold", "judge_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "protocol_hash": "cda8cfafe9da", "prof_total_s": 654.17, "prof_embed_s": 0.0, "prof_docker_s": 0.0, "prof_llm_io_s": 654.17, "prof_tok_in": 292, "prof_tok_out": 246, "prof_llm_calls": 1}
{"timestamp": "2026-07-28T15:02:15.252441", "benchmark": "gaia", "group": "no_mem", "phase": "test", "task_id": "gaia_7b5377b0-3f38-4103-8ad2-90fe89864c04", "task_desc": "Answer the following question accurately.\n\nQuestion: Find the value of x to the nearest tenth: Lx = (d/dx * (A * x-squared)) + 4-thousand'n'ninety-7 minus C\nWhere L is the last two digits of the year of the Venezuelan Declaration of Independence,\nA is the number of colors in the TikTok logo as of July 2023, excluding black and white,\nand C is the height of the average woman in the Philippines according to a July 2023 Business Insider article, rounded to the nearest whole centimeter", "augmented_prompt": "", "response": "Venezuelan Declaration of Independence: 1811 → last two digits L = 11.  \nTikTok logo colors (cyan and magenta, with black/white excluded) → A = 2.  \nAverage woman height in the Philippines from the July 2023 Business Insider article ≈ 149.6 cm → rounded to nearest whole cm C = 150.  \n\nEquation:  \nLx = d/dx (A x²) + 4097 − C  \n11x = 2·2·x + 4097 − 150  \n11x = 4x + 3947  \n7x = 3947  \nx = 3947 ÷ 7 ≈ 563.857…  \n\nRounded to the nearest tenth: 563.9\n\n563.9", "expected": "563.9", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "method": "exact_match", "execution_mode": "default", "error": "", "category": "", "level": "2", "patch_injected": false, "aug_len": 0, "iteration": 0, "iter_total": 3, "mutated": false, "fb_score": null, "fb_mode": "gold", "code_rev": "3f7502f7.ff40ae22", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "metadata_author": "critic", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "gold", "judge_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "protocol_hash": "cda8cfafe9da", "prof_total_s": 1536.05, "prof_embed_s": 0.0, "prof_docker_s": 0.0, "prof_llm_io_s": 1536.05, "prof_tok_in": 695, "prof_tok_out": 10033, "prof_llm_calls": 2}
