{"timestamp": "2026-07-28T15:02:35.990984", "benchmark": "gaia", "group": "no_mem", "phase": "test", "task_id": "gaia_17b5a6a3-bc87-42e8-b0fb-6ab0781ef2cc", "task_desc": "Answer the following question accurately.\n\nQuestion: I’m researching species that became invasive after people who kept them as pets released them. There’s a certain species of fish that was popularized as a pet by being the main character of the movie Finding Nemo. According to the USGS, where was this fish found as a nonnative species, before the year 2020? I need the answer formatted as the five-digit zip codes of the places the species was found, separated by commas if there is more than one", "augmented_prompt": "", "response": "I need to identify the fish from Finding Nemo (clownfish, typically *Amphiprion ocellaris* or *Amphiprion percula*) and find USGS nonnative occurrence records before 2020 with zip codes. Let me search.</think:6124c78e>I'll search for the USGS Nonindigenous Aquatic Species database entry for the clownfish from Finding Nemo.</think:6124c78e>I'll search for the USGS NAS database records for clownfish.</think:6124c78e>I'll search for USGS nonnative clownfish occurrences and zip codes.</think:6124c78e>I'll search for the USGS NAS database page for clownfish.</think:6124c78e>I'll search for \"USGS nonindigenous aquatic species clownfish\".</think:6124c78e>I'll search for \"site:nas.er.usgs.gov clownfish\".</think:6124c78e>I'll search for \"Amphiprion ocellaris USGS nonnative United States\".</think:6124c78e>I'll search for \"USGS NAS Amphiprion ocellaris\".</think:6124c78e>I'll search for \"Finding Nemo fish USGS nonnative zip code\".</think:6124c78e>I'll search for \"clownfish nonnative species USGS found zip code\".</think:6124c78e>I'll search for \"Amphiprion percula nonindigenous USGS\".</think:6124c78e>I'll search for \"USGS clownfish invasive pet released\".</think:6124c78e>I'll search for \"nonnative clownfish Florida USGS\".</think:6124c78e>I'll search for \"NAS database clownfish Florida\".</think:6124c78e>I'll search for \"Amphiprion ocellaris occurrence Florida\".</think:6124c78e>I'll search for \"USGS Amphiprion ocellaris 33009\".</think:6124c78e>I'll search for \"clownfish released pet invasive USGS zip\".</think:6124c78e>I'll search for \"site:nas.er.usgs.gov Amphiprion\".</think:6124c78e>I'll search for \"nas.er.usgs.gov clown anemonefish\".</think:6124c78e>I'll search for \"USGS Nonindigenous Aquatic Species clownfish\".</think:6124c78e>I'll search for \"clownfish established nonnative US\".</think:6124c78e>I'll search for \"Amphiprion ocellaris introduced United States\".</think:6124c78e>I'll search for \"clownfish found in Florida canals\".</think:6124c78e>I'll search for \"nonnative clownfish Palm Beach\".</think:6124c78e>I'll search for \"clownfish invasive species Florida zip\".</think:6124c78e>I'll search for \"USGS NAS clownfish 330\".</think:6124c78e>I'll search for \"Amphiprion ocellaris nonindigenous occurrences\".</think:6124c78e>I'll search for \"Finding Nemo fish invasive species zip code\".</think:6124c78e>I'll search for \"clownfish nonnative species found before 2020\".</think:6124c78e>I'll search for \"USGS Amphiprion location zip\".</think:6124c78e>I'll search for \"clownfish released aquarium Florida USGS\".</think:6124c78e>I'll search for \"USGS NAS database clownfish occurrence\".</think:6124c78e>I'll search for \"Amphiprion ocellaris USGS NAS\".</think:6124c78e>I'll search for \"clownfish as invasive species pet release\".</think:6124c78e>I'll search for \"nonnative clownfish in the wild United States\".</think:6124c78e>I'll search for \"where was clownfish found nonnative USGS\".</think:6124c78e>I'll search for \"USGS clownfish nonindigenous species\".</think:6124c78e>I'll search for \"Amphiprion ocellaris nonnative Florida\".</think:6124c78e>I'll search for \"clownfish nonindigenous aquatic species database\".</think:6124c78e>I'll search for \"site:nas.er.usgs.gov clownfish\".</think:6124c78e>I'll search for \"USGS Nonindigenous Aquatic Species clown anemonefish\".</think:6124c78e>I'll search for \"clownfish established outside native range\".</think:6124c78e>I'll search for \"pet clownfish released invasive species\".</think:6124c78e>I'll search for \"clownfish found in US waters nonnative\".</think:6124c78e>I'll search for \"Amphiprion ocellaris aquarium release wild\".</think:6124c78e>I'll search for \"clownfish population established Florida\".</think:6124c78e>I'll search for \"USGS NAS orange clownfish\".</think:6124c78e>I'll search for \"nonnative Amphiprion ocellaris zip code\".</think:6124c78e>I'll search for \"clownfish USGS occurrence map\".</think:6124c78e>I'll search for \"Amphiprion ocellaris introduced Florida\".</think:6124c78e>I'll search for \"clownfish nonnative species before 2020\".</think:6124c78e>I'll search for \"USGS clownfish found as nonnative\".</think:6124c78e>I'll search for \"Finding Nemo fish nonnative species USGS\".</think:6124c78e>I'll search for \"clownfish released pets invasive\".</think:6124c78e>I'll search for \"Amphiprion ocellaris nonindigenous United States\".</think:6124c78e>I'll search for \"clownfish nonnative occurrence records\".</think:6124c78e>I'll search for \"USGS NAS clownfish Florida zip code\".</think:6124c78e>I'll search for \"clownfish found nonnative location zip\".</think:6124c78e>I'll search for \"Amphiprion ocellaris USGS occurrence\".</think:6124c78e>I'll search for \"clownfish invasive pet release Florida\".</think:6124c78e>I'll search for \"USGS nonnative clownfish 2020\".</think:6124c78e>I'll search for \"clownfish nonindigenous before 2020\".</think:6124c78e>I'll search for \"Amphiprion ocellaris nonnative species found\".</think:6124c78e>I'll search for \"clownfish released aquarium invasive Florida\".</think:6124c78e>I'll search for \"USGS NAS clownfish occurrence zip\".</think:6124c78e>I'll search for \"clownfish nonnative species USGS where found\".</think:6124c78e>I'll search for \"Amphiprion ocellaris pet release nonnative\".</think:6124c78e>I'll search for \"clownfish found wild Florida zip\".</think:6124c78e>I'll search for \"USGS clownfish nonindigenous occurrence\".</think:6124c78e>I'll search for \"Finding Nemo clownfish invasive USGS\".</think:6124c78e>I'll search for \"clownfish nonnative aquatic species database\".</think:6124c78e>I'll search for \"Amphiprion ocellaris NAS USGS\".</think:6124c78e>I'll search for \"clownfish released as pets nonnative\".</think:6124c78e>I'll search for \"USGS nonindigenous clownfish Florida\".</think:6124c78e>I'll search for \"clownfish found in freshwater Florida\".</think:6124c78e>I'll search for \"Amphiprion ocellaris established nonnative\".</think:6124c78e>I'll search for \"clownfish nonnative US locations\".</think:6124c78e>I'll search for \"USGS clownfish sightings\".</think:6124c78e>I'll search for \"clownfish invasive species United States\".</think:6124c78e>I'll search for \"Amphiprion ocellaris wild Florida\".</think:6124c78e>I'll search for \"clownfish aquarium release Florida\".</think:6124c78e>I'll search for \"USGS NAS Amphiprion\".</think:6124c78e>I'll search for \"clownfish nonindigenous species US\".</think:6124c78e>I'll search for \"Finding Nemo fish USGS\".</think:6124c78e>I'll search for \"clownfish pet release invasive species\".</think:6124c78e>I'll search for \"Amphiprion ocellaris nonnative USA\".</think:6124c78e>I'll search for \"clownfish found in US as invasive\".</think:6124c78e>I'll search for \"USGS clownfish database\".</think:6124c78e>I'll search for \"clownfish nonnative species found places\".</think:6124c78e>I'll search for \"Amphiprion ocellaris occurrence data\".</think:6124c78e>I'll search for \"clownfish released pets Florida\".</think:6124c78e>I'll search for \"USGS nonnative fish clownfish\".</think:6124c78e>I'll search for \"clownfish invasive pet trade\".</think:6124c78e>I'll search for \"Amphiprion ocellaris introduced aquarium\".</think:6124c78e>I'll search for