{"timestamp": "2026-07-28T15:09:24.860433", "benchmark": "gaia", "group": "no_mem", "phase": "test", "task_id": "gaia_9e1fc53b-46ff-49a1-9d05-9e6faac34cc5", "task_desc": "Answer the following question accurately.\n\nQuestion: A 5-man group made up of one tank, one healer, and three DPS is doing a dungeon that was just released in World of Warcraft. Two are plate wearers and two are cloth wearers. At the final boss, both the tank and the healer are casting holy spells. Ice and fire are being used, each one by a different DPS. A bear from the group is attacking the boss. Metamorphosis is cast. The Kilt of the Forgotten One drops as loot, but no one can use it. If all", "augmented_prompt": "", "response": "The tank must be a Paladin (plate, holy), the healer a Priest (cloth, holy). The bear indicates a Druid (leather). To have two plate and two cloth, the remaining DPS are a plate class and a cloth class. Ice from a Death Knight (Frost) and fire from a Warlock (fire spells) satisfy the element clue, and Metamorphosis points to the Warlock. The unused loot being unusable fits a mail item with no mail wearer. The five unique classes are:\n\nDeath Knight, Druid, Paladin, Priest, Warlock", "expected": "Death Knight, Hunter, Paladin, Priest, Warlock", "score": 0.8, "em": 0.0, "method": "exact_match", "execution_mode": "default", "error": "", "category": "", "level": "3", "patch_injected": false, "aug_len": 0, "iteration": 2, "iter_total": 3, "mutated": false, "fb_score": null, "fb_mode": "gold", "code_rev": "3f7502f7.ff40ae22", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "metadata_author": "critic", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "gold", "judge_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "protocol_hash": "cda8cfafe9da", "prof_total_s": 506.61, "prof_embed_s": 0.0, "prof_docker_s": 0.0, "prof_llm_io_s": 506.61, "prof_tok_in": 769, "prof_tok_out": 11564, "prof_llm_calls": 2}
