{"timestamp": "2026-07-28T15:27:57.126480", "benchmark": "gaia", "group": "no_mem", "phase": "test", "task_id": "gaia_7b5377b0-3f38-4103-8ad2-90fe89864c04", "task_desc": "Answer the following question accurately.\n\nQuestion: Find the value of x to the nearest tenth: Lx = (d/dx * (A * x-squared)) + 4-thousand'n'ninety-7 minus C\nWhere L is the last two digits of the year of the Venezuelan Declaration of Independence,\nA is the number of colors in the TikTok logo as of July 2023, excluding black and white,\nand C is the height of the average woman in the Philippines according to a July 2023 Business Insider article, rounded to the nearest whole centimeter", "augmented_prompt": "", "response": "Venezuelan Declaration of Independence: 1811 → L = 11.  \nTikTok logo colors excluding black/white: cyan and pink → A = 2.  \nAverage woman height in Philippines (Business Insider, July 2023) ≈ 149.9 cm → rounded C = 150.  \n\nEquation:  \n11x = d/dx (2x²) + 4097 − 150  \n11x = 4x + 3947  \n7x = 3947  \nx = 3947 ÷ 7 ≈ 563.857…  \n\nRounded to the nearest tenth: 563.9\n\n563.9", "expected": "563.9", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "method": "exact_match", "execution_mode": "default", "error": "", "category": "", "level": "2", "patch_injected": false, "aug_len": 0, "iteration": 2, "iter_total": 3, "mutated": false, "fb_score": null, "fb_mode": "gold", "code_rev": "3f7502f7.ff40ae22", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "metadata_author": "critic", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "gold", "judge_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "protocol_hash": "cda8cfafe9da", "prof_total_s": 1261.53, "prof_embed_s": 0.0, "prof_docker_s": 0.0, "prof_llm_io_s": 1261.53, "prof_tok_in": 695, "prof_tok_out": 6022, "prof_llm_calls": 2}
