{"timestamp": "2026-07-28T21:05:22.380643", "benchmark": "gaia", "group": "amem", "phase": "test", "task_id": "gaia_a0068077-79f4-461a-adfe-75c1a4148545", "task_desc": "Answer the following question accurately.\n\nQuestion: What was the actual enrollment count of the clinical trial on H. pylori in acne vulgaris patients from Jan-May 2018 as listed on the NIH website?", "augmented_prompt": "## Memories from earlier attempts (A-Mem)\n\n- Task: Answer the following question accurately.\n\nQuestion: What was the actual enrollment count of the clinical trial on H. pylori in acne vulgaris patients from Jan-May 2018 as listed on the NIH website?\nAttempt: The ClinicalTrials.gov record for the interventional study on Helicobacter pylori eradication in acne vulgaris patients conducted from January to May 2018 lists an actual enrollment of 6", "response": "6", "expected": "90", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "method": "exact_match", "execution_mode": "default", "error": "", "category": "", "level": "1", "patch_injected": true, "aug_len": 445, "iteration": 1, "iter_total": 3, "mutated": false, "fb_score": 0.0, "fb_mode": "gold", "code_rev": "56816631.fcf27e88", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "metadata_author": "critic", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "gold", "judge_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "protocol_hash": "65cea4ee79fd", "prof_total_s": 535.9, "prof_embed_s": 0.0, "prof_docker_s": 0.0, "prof_llm_io_s": 535.9, "prof_tok_in": 727, "prof_tok_out": 1006, "prof_llm_calls": 2}
{"timestamp": "2026-07-28T21:05:31.029179", "benchmark": "gaia", "group": "amem", "phase": "test", "task_id": "gaia_0e9e85b8-52b9-4de4-b402-5f635ab9631f", "task_desc": "Answer the following question accurately.\n\nQuestion: What is the latest chronological year date written in the image on the webpage found when following the first citation reference link on the latest version of Carl Nebel's Wikipedia page as of August 2023?", "augmented_prompt": "## Memories from earlier attempts (A-Mem)\n\n- Task: Answer the following question accurately.\n\nQuestion: What is the latest chronological year date written in the image on the webpage found when following the first citation reference link on the latest version of Carl Nebel's Wikipedia page as of August 2023?\nAttempt: ```python\nimport requests, bs4, re\nurl = 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Carl_Nebel'\ntry:\n    resp = requests.get(url, timeout=", "response": "```python\nimport requests, json, datetime\nS = requests.Session()\napi = 'https://en.wikipedia.org/w/api.php'\nparams = {\n    'action':'query',\n    'format':'json',\n    'titles':'Carl_Nebel',\n    'prop':'revisions',\n    'rvlimit':1,\n    'rvdir':'older',\n    'rvtimestamp':'2023-08-31T23:59:59Z',\n    'rvprop':'ids|timestamp'\n}\nr = S.get(api, params=params)\nprint(r.url)\nprint(r.json())\n```", "expected": "1927", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "method": "exact_match", "execution_mode": "default", "error": "", "category": "", "level": "2", "patch_injected": true, "aug_len": 445, "iteration": 1, "iter_total": 3, "mutated": false, "fb_score": 0.0, "fb_mode": "gold", "code_rev": "56816631.fcf27e88", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "metadata_author": "critic", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "gold", "judge_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "protocol_hash": "65cea4ee79fd", "prof_total_s": 508.88, "prof_embed_s": 0.0, "prof_docker_s": 0.0, "prof_llm_io_s": 508.88, "prof_tok_in": 365, "prof_tok_out": 558, "prof_llm_calls": 1}
{"timestamp": "2026-07-28T21:05:39.375010", "benchmark": "gaia", "group": "amem", "phase": "test", "task_id": "gaia_50ad0280-0819-4bd9-b275-5de32d3b5bcb", "task_desc": "Answer the following question accurately.\n\nQuestion: Pull out the sentence in the following 5x7 block of text. Read from left to right and use all of the letters in order:\n\nTHESE\nAGULL\nGLIDE\nDPEAC\nEFULL\nYTOMY\nCHAIR", "augmented_prompt": "## Memories from earlier attempts (A-Mem)\n\n- Task: Answer the following question accurately.\n\nQuestion: Pull out the sentence in the following 5x7 block of text. Read from left to right and use all of the letters in order:\n\nTHESE\nAGULL\nGLIDE\nDPEAC\nEFULL\nYTOMY\nCHAIR\nAttempt: THE SEAGULL GLIDED PEACEFULLY TO MY CHAIR.", "response": "THE SEAGULL GLIDED PEACEFULLY TO MY CHAIR.", "expected": "The seagull glided peacefully to my chair.", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "method": "exact_match", "execution_mode": "default", "error": "", "category": "", "level": "1", "patch_injected": true, "aug_len": 317, "iteration": 1, "iter_total": 3, "mutated": false, "fb_score": 1.0, "fb_mode": "gold", "code_rev": "56816631.fcf27e88", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "metadata_author": "critic", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "gold", "judge_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "protocol_hash": "65cea4ee79fd", "prof_total_s": 535.2, "prof_embed_s": 0.0, "prof_docker_s": 0.0, "prof_llm_io_s": 535.2, "prof_tok_in": 372, "prof_tok_out": 1066, "prof_llm_calls": 1}
