{"timestamp": "2026-07-28T21:06:54.267606", "benchmark": "gaia", "group": "amem", "phase": "test", "task_id": "gaia_8d46b8d6-b38a-47ff-ac74-cda14cf2d19b", "task_desc": "Answer the following question accurately.\n\nQuestion: What percentage of the total penguin population according to the upper estimates on english Wikipedia at the end of 2012 is made up by the penguins in this file that don't live on Dream Island or have beaks longer than 42mm? Round to the nearest five decimal places.", "augmented_prompt": "## Memories from earlier attempts (A-Mem)\n\n- Task: Answer the following question accurately.\n\nQuestion: What percentage of the total penguin population according to the upper estimates on english Wikipedia at the end of 2012 is made up by the penguins in this file that don't live on Dream Island or have beaks longer than 42mm? Round to the nearest five decimal places.\nAttempt: ```python\nimport os, glob\nfor root, dirs, files in os.walk('.'):\n", "response": "```python\nimport os\nfor root, dirs, files in os.walk('.'):\n    for f in files:\n        path = os.path.join(root, f)\n        print(path)\n```", "expected": "0.00033", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "method": "exact_match", "execution_mode": "default", "error": "", "category": "", "level": "3", "patch_injected": true, "aug_len": 445, "iteration": 1, "iter_total": 3, "mutated": false, "fb_score": 0.0, "fb_mode": "gold", "code_rev": "56816631.fcf27e88", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "metadata_author": "critic", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "gold", "judge_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "protocol_hash": "65cea4ee79fd", "prof_total_s": 559.05, "prof_embed_s": 0.0, "prof_docker_s": 0.0, "prof_llm_io_s": 559.05, "prof_tok_in": 382, "prof_tok_out": 817, "prof_llm_calls": 1}
