{"timestamp": "2026-07-28T21:08:48.526465", "benchmark": "gaia", "group": "amem", "phase": "test", "task_id": "gaia_389793a7-ca17-4e82-81cb-2b3a2391b4b9", "task_desc": "Answer the following question accurately.\n\nQuestion: You are a telecommunications engineer who wants to build cell phone towers on a stretch of road. In the reference file is a layout of the road and nearby houses. Each dash, \"-\", is a marker indicating a mile. Each capital H indicates a house located next to a mile marker, appearing above or below the stretch of road. Each cell phone tower can cover houses located next to the road within a 4-mile radius. Find the minimum number of cell phone to", "augmented_prompt": "## Memories from earlier attempts (A-Mem)\n\n- Task: Answer the following question accurately.\n\nQuestion: You are a telecommunications engineer who wants to build cell phone towers on a stretch of road. In the reference file is a layout of the road and nearby houses. Each dash, \"-\", is a marker indicating a mile. Each capital H indicates a house located next to a mile marker, appearing above or below the stretch of road. Each cell phone tower ", "response": "<tool_calls:6124c78e>\n<tool_call:6124c78e>web_search\t\n```json\n{\"query\":\"\\\"telecommunications engineer\\\" \\\"cell phone towers\\\" \\\"stretch of road\\\" \\\"reference file\\\" \\\"Each dash\\\" \\\"Each capital H\\\"\"}\n```</tool_call:6124c78e>\n</tool_calls:6124c78e>", "expected": "3", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "method": "exact_match", "execution_mode": "default", "error": "", "category": "", "level": "1", "patch_injected": true, "aug_len": 445, "iteration": 1, "iter_total": 3, "mutated": false, "fb_score": 0.0, "fb_mode": "gold", "code_rev": "56816631.fcf27e88", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "metadata_author": "critic", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "gold", "judge_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "protocol_hash": "65cea4ee79fd", "prof_total_s": 601.52, "prof_embed_s": 0.0, "prof_docker_s": 