{"timestamp": "2026-07-28T21:08:52.324133", "benchmark": "gaia", "group": "amem", "phase": "test", "task_id": "gaia_27d5d136-8563-469e-92bf-fd103c28b57c", "task_desc": "Answer the following question accurately.\n\nQuestion: ¬(A ∧ B) ↔ (¬A ∨ ¬B)\n¬(A ∨ B) ↔ (¬A ∧ ¬B)\n(A → B) ↔ (¬B → ¬A)\n(A → B) ↔ (¬A ∨ B)\n(¬A → B) ↔ (A ∨ ¬B)\n¬(A → B) ↔ (A ∧ ¬B)\n\nWhich of the above is not logically equivalent to the rest? Provide the full statement that doesn't fit.", "augmented_prompt": "## Memories from earlier attempts (A-Mem)\n\n- Task: Answer the following question accurately.\n\nQuestion: ¬(A ∧ B) ↔ (¬A ∨ ¬B)\n¬(A ∨ B) ↔ (¬A ∧ ¬B)\n(A → B) ↔ (¬B → ¬A)\n(A → B) ↔ (¬A ∨ B)\n(¬A → B) ↔ (A ∨ ¬B)\n¬(A → B) ↔ (A ∧ ¬B)\n\nWhich of the above is not logically equivalent to the rest? Provide the full statement that doesn't fit.\nAttempt: ```python\nimport itertools\n\nformulas = {\n    '1': lambda A,B: (not (A and B)) == ((not A) or (not B)),\n  ", "response": "```python\nimport itertools\n\nformulas = [\n    (\"1\", lambda A,B: (not (A and B)) == ((not A) or (not B))),\n    (\"2\", lambda A,B: (not (A or B)) == ((not A) and (not B))),\n    (\"3\", lambda A,B: ((A implies B) if False else (not A or B)) == ((not B) or (not A))),  # need proper impl\n]\n\n# Let's just define implication\ndef impl(P,Q):\n    return (not P) or Q\n\nstatements = [\n    (\"1: ¬(A ∧ B) ↔ (¬A ∨ ¬B)\", lambda A,B: (not (A and B)) == ((not A) or (not B))),\n    (\"2: ¬(A ∨ B) ↔ (¬A ∧ ¬B)\", lambda A,B: (not (A or B)) == ((not A) and (not B))),\n    (\"3: (A → B) ↔ (¬B → ¬A)\", lambda A,B: impl(A,B) == impl(not B, not A)),\n    (\"4: (A → B) ↔ (¬A ∨ B)\", lambda A,B: impl(A,B) == ((not A) or B)),\n    (\"5: (¬A → B) ↔ (A ∨ ¬B)\", lambda A,B: impl(not A,B) == (A or (not B))),\n    (\"6: ¬(A → B) ↔ (A ∧ ¬B)\", lambda A,B: (not impl(A,B)) == (A and (not B))),\n]\n\nfor name, f in statements:\n    results = [f(A,B) for A,B in itertools.product([True,False], repeat=2)]\n    print(name, results, all(results))\n```", "expected": "(¬A → B) ↔ (A ∨ ¬B)", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "method": "exact_match", "execution_mode": "default", "error": "", "category": "", "level": "1", "patch_injected": true, "aug_len": 445, "iteration": 1, "iter_total": 3, "mutated": false, "fb_score": 1.0, "fb_mode": "gold", "code_rev": "56816631.fcf27e88", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "metadata_author": "critic", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "gold", "judge_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "protocol_hash": "65cea4ee79fd", "prof_total_s": 593.41, "prof_embed_s": 0.0, "prof_docker_s": 0.0, "prof_llm_io_s": 593.41, "prof_tok_in": 480, "prof_tok_out": 1082, "prof_llm_calls": 1}
{"timestamp": "2026-07-28T21:08:58.074405", "benchmark": "gaia", "group": "amem", "phase": "test", "task_id": "gaia_7cc4acfa-63fd-4acc-a1a1-e8e529e0a97f", "task_desc": "Answer the following question accurately.\n\nQuestion: The attached spreadsheet contains the sales of menu items for a regional fast-food chain. Which city had the greater total sales: Wharvton or Algrimand?", "augmented_prompt": "## Memories from earlier attempts (A-Mem)\n\n- Task: Answer the following question accurately.\n\nQuestion: The attached spreadsheet contains the sales of menu items for a regional fast-food chain. Which city had the greater total sales: Wharvton or Algrimand?\nAttempt: The prompt references an attached spreadsheet with sales figures for menu items across cities, including Wharvton and Algrimand, but no such file or data has been provided in this", "response": "</think:6124c78e>I'll check the environment for any attached files or data.\n\n```python\nimport os, glob, sys\nprint(os.listdir('.'))\nprint('---')\nfor root, dirs, files in os.walk('.'):\n    for f in files:\n        if f.endswith(('.csv','.xlsx','.xls','.json','.txt','.tsv')):\n            print(os.path.join(root, f))\n```", "expected": "Wharvton", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "method": "exact_match", "execution_mode": "default", "error": "", "category": "", "level": "2", "patch_injected": true, "aug_len": 445, "iteration": 1, "iter_total": 3, "mutated": false, "fb_score": 0.0, "fb_mode": "gold", "code_rev": "56816631.fcf27e88", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "metadata_author": "critic", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "gold", "judge_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "protocol_hash": "65cea4ee79fd", "prof_total_s": 584.63, "prof_embed_s": 0.0, "prof_docker_s": 0.0, "prof_llm_io_s": 584.63, "prof_tok_in": 351, "prof_tok_out": 360, "prof_llm_calls": 1}
