{"timestamp": "2026-07-28T21:11:16.576865", "benchmark": "gaia", "group": "amem", "phase": "test", "task_id": "gaia_4d0aa727-86b1-406b-9b33-f870dd14a4a5", "task_desc": "Answer the following question accurately.\n\nQuestion: The attached file lists the locomotives owned by a local railroad museum. It gives each locomotive’s identifying number, operating status, and the name of the daily excursion it heads, if operational. What are the odds that today’s Sunset Picnic Trip will use a steam locomotive? Assume that each day’s excursion picks one of its assigned locomotives at random, and express the answer in the form “1 in 4”, “1 in 5”, etc.", "augmented_prompt": "## Memories from earlier attempts (A-Mem)\n\n- Task: Answer the following question accurately.\n\nQuestion: The attached file lists the locomotives owned by a local railroad museum. It gives each locomotive’s identifying number, operating status, and the name of the daily excursion it heads, if operational. What are the odds that today’s Sunset Picnic Trip will use a steam locomotive? Assume that each day’s excursion picks one of its assigned lo", "response": "The attached file containing the locomotive data is not available in this environment, so it is impossible to count the operational locomotives assigned to the Sunset Picnic Trip or determine how many of those are steam. Without that information, the odds cannot be computed.\n\nCannot be determined", "expected": "1 in 3", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "method": "exact_match", "execution_mode": "default", "error": "", "category": "", "level": "2", "patch_injected": true, "aug_len": 445, "iteration": 1, "iter_total": 3, "mutated": false, "fb_score": 0.0, "fb_mode": "gold", "code_rev": "56816631.fcf27e88", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "metadata_author": "critic", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "gold", "judge_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "protocol_hash": "65cea4ee79fd", "prof_total_s": 662.17, "prof_embed_s": 0.0, "prof_docker_s": 0.0, "p