{"timestamp": "2026-07-28T21:11:16.938918", "benchmark": "gaia", "group": "amem", "phase": "test", "task_id": "gaia_a3fbeb63-0e8c-4a11-bff6-0e3b484c3e9c", "task_desc": "Answer the following question accurately.\n\nQuestion: How many slides in this PowerPoint presentation mention crustaceans?", "augmented_prompt": "## Memories from earlier attempts (A-Mem)\n\n- Task: Answer the following question accurately.\n\nQuestion: How many slides in this PowerPoint presentation mention crustaceans?\nAttempt: Since no PowerPoint file or content was provided in this environment and no tools are available to access any external presentation, there are no slides to examine. Consequently, the number of slides that mention crustaceans is zero.\n\n0", "response": "```python\nimport os, glob, sys\n\n# list current directory and common locations\nfor root in ['.', '/', '/home', '/tmp', '/mnt', '/data']:\n    try:\n        print(root, os.listdir(root)[:50])\n    except Exception as e:\n        print(root, 'err', e)\n\nprint('--- pptx search ---')\nfor f in glob.glob('**/*.pptx', recursive=True):\n    print(f)\nfor f in glob.glob('**/*.ppt', recursive=True):\n    print(f)\n```", "expected": "4", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "method": "exact_match", "execution_mode": "default", "error": "", "category": "", "level": "1", "patch_injected": true, "aug_len": 418, "iteration": 1, "iter_total": 3, "mutated": false, "fb_score": 0.0, "fb_mode": "gold", "code_rev": "56816631.fcf27e88", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "metadata_author": "critic", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "gold", "judge_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "protocol_hash": "65cea4ee79fd", "prof_total_s": 549.67, "prof_embed_s": 0.0, "prof_docker_s": 0.0, "prof_llm_io_s": 549.67, "prof_tok_in": 311, "prof_tok_out": 546, "prof_llm_calls": 1}
