{"timestamp": "2026-07-28T21:12:16.761521", "benchmark": "gaia", "group": "amem", "phase": "test", "task_id": "gaia_4d51c4bf-4b0e-4f3d-897b-3f6687a7d9f2", "task_desc": "Answer the following question accurately.\n\nQuestion: This spreadsheet contains a list of clients for a retractable awning company. Each client has ordered a new awning for the back of their house within the last 90 days. The company makes different designs depending on whether the awning is made to block sunrises or sunsets. In this region, houses with odd-numbered street addresses face east, and houses with even-numbered street addresses face west. How many of these clients will be receiving th", "augmented_prompt": "## Memories from earlier attempts (A-Mem)\n\n- Task: Answer the following question accurately.\n\nQuestion: This spreadsheet contains a list of clients for a retractable awning company. Each client has ordered a new awning for the back of their house within the last 90 days. The company makes different designs depending on whether the awning is made to block sunrises or sunsets. In this region, houses with odd-numbered street addresses face east", "response": "The question requires counting clients with even-numbered street addresses (west-facing, thus receiving the sunset awning), but the actual spreadsheet data listing the clients and their street addresses was not included in the prompt. Without that data, the count cannot be computed.\n\nCannot be determined (spreadsheet data not provided)", "expected": "8", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "method": "exact_match", "execution_mode": "default", "error": "", "category": "", "level": "2", "patch_injected": true, "aug_len": 445, "iteration": 1, "iter_total": 3, "mutated": false, "fb_score": 0.0, "fb_mode": "gold", "code_rev": "56816631.fcf27e88", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "metadata_author": "critic", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "gold", "judge_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "protocol_hash": "65cea4ee79fd", "prof_to