{"timestamp": "2026-07-28T21:18:15.745485", "benchmark": "gaia", "group": "amem", "phase": "test", "task_id": "gaia_72c06643-a2fa-4186-aa5c-9ec33ae9b445", "task_desc": "Answer the following question accurately.\n\nQuestion: What is the volume in milliliters of a system comprised of 0.312 kg Freon-12 refrigerant when placed at the bottom of the Marianas Trench and allowed to stabilize at the Trench's peak temperature, rounded to the nearest mL? Provide your answer as just an integer value.", "augmented_prompt": "## Memories from earlier attempts (A-Mem)\n\n- Task: Answer the following question accurately.\n\nQuestion: What is the volume in milliliters of a system comprised of 0.312 kg Freon-12 refrigerant when placed at the bottom of the Marianas Trench and allowed to stabilize at the Trench's peak temperature, rounded to the nearest mL? Provide your answer as just an integer value.\nAttempt: 190", "response": "The mass of Freon-12 is 0.312 kg = 312 g. At the bottom of the Marianas Trench the pressure is about 108.6 MPa and the bottom water peak temperature is near 4 °C. The saturated liquid density of R-12 at ~4 °C is roughly 1.36 g/mL; compression to ~108 MPa increases the density to about 1.64 g/mL. Thus the volume is 312 g / 1.64 g/mL ≈ 190 mL.\n\n190", "expected": "55", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "method": "exact_match", "execution_mode": "default", "error": "", "category": "", "level": "3", "patch_injected": true, "aug_len": 386, "iteration": 1, "iter_total": 3, "mutated": false, "fb_score": 0.0, "fb_mode": "gold", "code_rev": "56816631.fcf27e88", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "metadata_author": "critic", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "gold", "judge_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "protocol_hash": "65cea4ee79fd", "prof_total_s": 659.64, "prof_embed_s": 0.0, "prof_docker_s": 0.0, "prof_llm_io_s": 659.64, "prof_tok_in": 769, "prof_tok_out": 9087, "prof_llm_calls": 2}
{"timestamp": "2026-07-28T21:18:15.833492", "benchmark": "gaia", "group": "amem", "phase": "test", "task_id": "gaia_20194330-9976-4043-8632-f8485c6c71b2", "task_desc": "Answer the following question accurately.\n\nQuestion: The YouTube channel Game Grumps began a Let’s Play of the game Sonic the Hedgehog (2006) in the year 2012. Thirty seconds into the first episode, a phrase is shown on the screen in white letters on a red background. How many times does the letter \"E\" appear in this phrase?", "augmented_prompt": "## Memories from earlier attempts (A-Mem)\n\n- Task: Answer the following question accurately.\n\nQuestion: The YouTube channel Game Grumps began a Let’s Play of the game Sonic the Hedgehog (2006) in the year 2012. Thirty seconds into the first episode, a phrase is shown on the screen in white letters on a red background. How many times does the letter \"E\" appear in this phrase?\nAttempt: 3\n- Task: Answer the following question accurately.\n\nQuestion: The YouTube channel Game Grumps began a Let’s Play of the game Sonic the Hedgehog (2006) in the year 2012. Thirty seconds into the first episode, a phrase is shown on the screen in white letters on a red background. How many times does the letter \"E\" appear in this phrase?\nAttempt: I recall that in the first episode of Game Grumps' Sonic t", "response": "I recall that early in Game Grumps’ first Sonic the Hedgehog (2006) episode, around the 30‑second mark, the editors cut to a solid red screen with white text reading “WORST GAME EVER” (a similar variant sometimes quoted is “THIS GAME IS A PIECE OF SHIT”). Counting the letter E in “WORST GAME EVER”: WORST has 0, GAME has 1, EVER has 2 — total 3. (The alternative phrase also contains exactly 3 E’s.)\n\n3", "expected": "4", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "method": "exact_match", "execution_mode": "default", "error": "", "category": "", "level": "2", "patch_injected": true, "aug_len": 791, "iteration": 2, "iter_total": 3, "mutated": false, "fb_score": 0.0, "f