{"timestamp": "2026-07-28T21:23:16.947742", "benchmark": "gaia", "group": "amem", "phase": "test", "task_id": "gaia_7b5377b0-3f38-4103-8ad2-90fe89864c04", "task_desc": "Answer the following question accurately.\n\nQuestion: Find the value of x to the nearest tenth: Lx = (d/dx * (A * x-squared)) + 4-thousand'n'ninety-7 minus C\nWhere L is the last two digits of the year of the Venezuelan Declaration of Independence,\nA is the number of colors in the TikTok logo as of July 2023, excluding black and white,\nand C is the height of the average woman in the Philippines according to a July 2023 Business Insider article, rounded to the nearest whole centimeter", "augmented_prompt": "## Memories from earlier attempts (A-Mem)\n\n- Task: Answer the following question accurately.\n\nQuestion: Find the value of x to the nearest tenth: Lx = (d/dx * (A * x-squared)) + 4-thousand'n'ninety-7 minus C\nWhere L is the last two digits of the year of the Venezuelan Declaration of Independence,\nA is the number of colors in the TikTok logo as of July 2023, excluding black and white,\nand C is the height of the average woman in the Philippine", "response": "L = 11 (Venezuelan Declaration of Independence in 1811).  \nA = 2 (TikTok logo accent colors: pink/magenta and cyan, excluding black/white).  \nC = 150 cm (average Filipino woman’s height ~149.6 cm per the July 2023 Business Insider article, rounded to nearest whole cm).\n\nEquation:  \n11x = d/dx (2x²) + 4097 − 150  \n11x = 4x + 3947  \n7x = 3947  \nx = 3947 ÷ 7 ≈ 563.857…\n\nRounded to the nearest tenth: 563.9\n\n563.9", "expected": "563.9", "score": 1.0, "em": 1.0, "method": "exact_match", "execution_mode": "default", "error": "", "category": "", "level": "2", "patch_injected": true, "aug_len": 445, "iteration": 1, "iter_total": 3, "mutated": false, "fb_score": 1.0, "fb_mode": "gold", "code_rev": "56816631.fcf27e88", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "metadata_author": "critic", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance"