{"timestamp": "2026-07-28T21:24:24.341564", "benchmark": "gaia", "group": "amem", "phase": "test", "task_id": "gaia_16d825ff-1623-4176-a5b5-42e0f5c2b0ac", "task_desc": "Answer the following question accurately.\n\nQuestion: What time was the Tri-Rail train that carried the most passengers on May 27, 2019 scheduled to arrive in Pompano Beach? Express your answer in the 12-hour digital clock format without leading zero if any, and include whether it is AM or PM.", "augmented_prompt": "## Memories from earlier attempts (A-Mem)\n\n- Task: Answer the following question accurately.\n\nQuestion: What time was the Tri-Rail train that carried the most passengers on May 27, 2019 scheduled to arrive in Pompano Beach? Express your answer in the 12-hour digital clock format without leading zero if any, and include whether it is AM or PM.\nAttempt: The Tri-Rail train with the highest ridership on May 27, 2019 was scheduled to arrive at th\n- Task: Answer the following question accurately.\n\nQuestion: What time was the Tri-Rail train that carried the most passengers on May 27, 2019 scheduled to arrive in Pompano Beach? Express your answer in the 12-hour digital clock format without leading zero if any, and include whether it is AM or PM.\nAttempt: 8:15 AM", "response": "Based on the Tri-Rail ridership records for May 27, 2019 (Memorial Day), the train carrying the most passengers that day was scheduled to arrive at the Pompano Beach station at 8:15 AM.\n\n8:15 AM", "expected": "6:41 PM", "score": 0.0, "em": 0.0, "method": "exact_match", "execution_mode": "default", "error": "", "category": "", "level": "2", "patch_injected": true, "aug_len": 764, "iteration": 2, "iter_total": 3, "mutated": false, "fb_score": 0.0, "fb_mode": "gold", "code_rev": "56816631.fcf27e88", "critic_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "metadata_author": "critic", "c_meta": false, "c_policy": "guarded", "score_provenance": "gold", "judge_model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "protocol_hash": "65cea4ee79fd", "prof_total_s": 458.29, "pro